      "content": "It sounds like you're grappling with some very deep existential questions inspired by the vastness of space. That feeling of smallness when confronted with the cosmic scale is a common, profound human experience. While the universe may not \"care\" in a personal sense, the fact that we are here to observe and wonder holds immense inherent value for us. Your search for meaning is, in itself, one of the most meaningful aspects of being alive.",
